# Single source of truth for the sibling-repository pins. Consumed by BOTH
# the CI workflow (.github/workflows/tests.yml installs the siblings at
# exactly these commits) and the Space deploy (deploy/hf-space/Dockerfile
# ARG defaults must equal these values -- tests/unit/test_deploy_pins.py
# fails on any drift). Update on every release, together with the
# Dockerfile's JWST_TOOL_SHA (which pins the commit being deployed and has
# no CI counterpart: CI tests the checkout itself).
VULCAN_JAX_SHA=3282c6adc4f487d777042257d5d777951e1ce3f6
VULCAN_FORWARD_SHA=2208adec57f1d43885cbd930c0add83235cbd921
